OL,3,GNEWSAHaematology centre for cancer
OL,4,Apatients at risk over 'disgraceful'
OL,5,Afunds move
OL,6,
OL,7,FA plan to build a haematology centre in
OL,8,FBelfast for cancer patients has been
OL,9,Fput at risk after the Department of
OL,10,FHealth (DoH) withdrew funding, the
OL,11,Fchief executive of the Belfast Trust
OL,12,Fhas said.
OL,14,FThe move was described as "disgraceful"
OL,15,Fduring Thursday's session of Stormont's
OL,16,Fhealth committee after trust officials
OL,17,Fsaid the department had now decided to
OL,18,Ftake back #1.5m from the project.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
