OL,3,GNEWSAHaematology centre for cancer
OL,4,Apatients at risk over 'disgraceful'
OL,5,Afunds move
OL,6,
OL,7,FBelfast Health Trust had planned to
OL,8,Fmove 80 staff out of an area of Belfast
OL,9,FCity Hospital to make way for the new
OL,10,Funit, but having reviewed the proposal
OL,11,Fthe DoH withdrew related funding.
OL,13,FThe DoH said it will fund most of the
OL,14,Fadditional cost and will work with the
OL,15,FTrust to control growing costs of
OL,16,Fcapital projects.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
